# Avatar render steps (TALKSHOW_AVATAR_STEPS) with every latency fix except the
# pacing change, i.e. arm D of latency.arms. Canned host lines play from the cache
# (warmed at the default 5 steps), so the arms differ only in live-rendered lines.
# Pair with `python -m eval.avatar_steps_samples` to judge face quality per step count.
# Every arm pins the FIFO hand-raise queue (TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo), as in the October
# runs: the LLM host is the code default and bypasses most of these fixes.
S5 TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_AVATAR_STEPS=5 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
S4 TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_AVATAR_STEPS=4 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
S3 TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_AVATAR_STEPS=3 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
S2 TALKSHOW_PRERENDER_CANNED=1 TALKSHOW_POLL_DURING_OPEN_FLOOR=1 TALKSHOW_DRAFT_AHEAD=1 TALKSHOW_AVATAR_STEPS=2 TALKSHOW_HOST_DECIDE=fifo
